@base = http://localhost:8080
@student_token = 在此粘贴学生access_token
@teacher_token = 在此粘贴教师access_token
@counselor_token = 在此粘贴辅导员access_token
@secretary_token = 在此粘贴教学秘书access_token
@admin_token = 在此粘贴管理员access_token
@enrollment_id = 1
@leave_id = 1
@grade_review_id = 1
@task_id = 1

### 1 登录。切换user_name可取得其他角色令牌，日期和业务ID按实际返回修改。
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_name":"student_demo","password":"Demo@123456","device_code":"demo-phone"}

### 2 个人身份
GET {{base}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3 可见选课批次
GET {{base}}/api/enrollments/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 4 可选课程，batch_course_id取data.items里的id
GET {{base}}/api/enrollments/options?batch_id=1&page_no=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 5 选课。同一业务重试沿用request_key；新业务用新的唯一键。
POST {{base}}/api/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"batch_course_id":"1","request_key":"demo-enroll-001"}

### 6 本人课表
GET {{base}}/api/timetables?semester_id=1&week_no=1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 7 课程详情
GET {{base}}/api/courses/1?teaching_class_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 8 教师登录，将access_token填入teacher_token
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_name":"teacher_demo","password":"Demo@123456","device_code":"demo-teacher-pc"}

### 9 教师成绩列表，获取enrollment_id、已有grade的version
GET {{base}}/api/courses/1/grades?teaching_class_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 10 保存成绩草稿；已有成绩必须提供返回的最新version
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/1/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teaching_class_id":"1","items":[{"enrollment_id":"{{enrollment_id}}","usual_score":"80.00","final_score":"90.00","exam_flag":0,"version":0}]}

### 11 提交成绩审核，记录返回的grade_review.id
POST {{base}}/api/courses/1/grades/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teaching_class_id":"1"}

### 12 教学秘书审核，不能用教师本人账号审核
POST {{base}}/api/grade-reviews/{{grade_review_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":1,"review_comment":"核对通过"}

### 13 学生只能看已发布成绩
GET {{base}}/api/grades/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 14 学生请假，修改为实际起止时间。<=3天辅导员，>3天还需院系审批。
POST {{base}}/api/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"leave_type":"事假","start_time":"2026-09-10T08:00:00+08:00","end_time":"2026-09-12T08:00:00+08:00","leave_reason":"演示申请","action":"submit","file_ids":[]}

### 15 辅导员待办
GET {{base}}/api/leaves/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{counselor_token}}

### 16 辅导员批准。退回用decision=3并填写opinion；apply_round/node_order取当前单据。
POST {{base}}/api/leaves/{{leave_id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{counselor_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"apply_round":1,"node_order":1,"decision":1,"opinion":"同意"}

### 17 学生销假
POST {{base}}/api/leaves/{{leave_id}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 18 模拟校园卡余额
GET {{base}}/api/cards/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 19 创建模拟充值单，不会真实扣款。验签回调样例用tools/mock_payment.py。
POST {{base}}/api/cards/recharges
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":"20.00","pay_channel":"MOCK_PAY","request_key":"demo-recharge-001"}

### 20 图书检索
GET {{base}}/api/library/books?keywords=Java
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 21 图书预约
POST {{base}}/api/library/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_id":"1","request_key":"demo-reserve-001"}

### 22 辅导员向所辖班级发布通知
POST {{base}}/api/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{counselor_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"notice_title":"班级通知","content":"请查看班级事项。","urgency_level":2,"need_ack":1,"scopes":[{"scope_type":3,"class_id":"1"}],"file_ids":[]}

### 23 站内消息，定时分发后可见
GET {{base}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 24 鸿蒙设备登记，须和当前登录device_code一致并再次核验密码
POST {{base}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_code":"demo-phone","device_name":"演示手机","device_type":"phone","password":"Demo@123456"}

### 25 今日卡片数据，不含原生ArkTS卡片代码
GET {{base}}/api/harmony/cards/today
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 26 管理后台用户导出，待完成后从result_file_id下载
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"task_type":"USER_EXPORT","task_params":{"org_id":"2"}}

### 27 查询异步任务
GET {{base}}/api/admin/tasks/{{task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 28 导入流程：先POST /api/files上传CSV，创建USER_IMPORT/GRADE_IMPORT，等待phase=validated且error_count=0，最后确认
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tasks/{{task_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed":true}

### 29 后台基础数据：resource支持courses/classes/classrooms/counselors/prerequisites/aid-batches/books/book-copies/configs/exams等
GET {{base}}/api/admin/data/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 30 基础统计
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 31 配置文件大小上限，若已有同键配置须带该记录id更新
POST {{base}}/api/admin/data/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed":true,"config_group":"file","config_key":"file.max_mb","config_name":"最大上传MB","config_value":"50","value_type":"number","is_enabled":1}

### 32 授予学生角色，先用用户创建接口建立账号；角色id以后台返回为准
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/users/8/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed":true,"role_ids":["1"]}
